%% TECH-016 SDD and the test strategy
%% How a requirement is checked, from card to verification.
flowchart TD
    A[Card: requirements and test plan] -->|Specified| B[Build: code and unit tests]
    B --> C[Test: browser tests, smoke test]
    C --> D[Verify: verification.md per requirement and per kind of check]
    D --> E[Review: code review, security]
    E --> F[Done: requirements as built]
    F --> G[After deploy: smoke tests and accessibility checklist on the live site]
    T[wiki/system/testing.md] -.->|which kind of check for what| A
    T -.-> C
